           "the nerve of the closed ", Cell[BoxData[StyleBox["r", "TI"]], 
            "InlineFormula", FontSize -> 0.9*Inherited, ExpressionUUID -> 
             "b6da4f7b-6c6c-4f4f-bc41-7ab1b259aef9"], "-balls"}], 
         "GuideText", ExpressionUUID -> 
          "781007f9-6197-4ee9-ab67-afd35ec899e2"], 
        Cell[TextData[{Cell[BoxData[TemplateBox[{Cell[TextData[
